T:First of May
% NFF Book 2019
S:collected from Joe Cashmere, Sydney NSW
S:John Meredith Collection, NLA
N:This tune also collected in Australia:
N:- from Joe Yates, John Meredith Collection, NLA as "Joe Yates Skillett Pot" &/or "Sofala Cuckoo"
H:Older versions: This tune is part of a family of tunes based around "Little Beggarman", & "Redhaired Boy" & Colcannon
H:- Elias Howe "The Musician's Companion" 1843 p.143 #2 as "Cuckoo Sett (tune 5)"
H:- Kerr's Vol 4 No 270, (c.1880), as "1st of May"
H:- https://tunearch.org/wiki/Little_Beggarman
